section: ghc-pkg
synopsis: Add --always-use-cache flag
mrs: !16941

description: {
Added a flag `--always-use-cache` to `ghc-pkg`, which forces use of
`package.cache` regardless of its timestamp. This is intended for use
in scenarios where timestamps are unreliable but the user has reason
to trust the validity of the cache, for example the Buck2 build system
doesn't guarantee to maintain timestamps on build artifacts.
}
